{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boe is sick and facing eviction. His only friends are the tribe of mice who live in his apartment who are staring down extermination when Boe loses his home. In desperation, the mice send their hero, The Chosen One, on a dangerous quest to rally the building\u2019s tenants and save them all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the world beyond Boe\u2019s walls is treacherous. Reluctant tenants, scheming ants, and bizarre money-making plots stand in your way. To succeed, you\u2019ll have to brawl, bargain, and uncover a deeper plot lurking behind the eviction notice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As The Chosen One, you\u2019ll fight through a crumbling apartment building overrun by bumbling mice, power-hungry bugs, and eccentric neighbors. Each apartment is a new battleground, another signature to win, a new obstacle to outsmart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Brawling\u00a0</strong><br>Throw tiny fists in big fights, help friends, and make deals across apartments filled with ants, beetles, and other weirdos. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/3fa4a93e6bbb780804449dfd9b6aa903.avif?t=1772949369\" width=1560 height=510 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal Of Quirky Weapons</strong> <br>Use forks, hammers, flamethrowers, and other wacky weapons in your quest!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/f8c660fc62f90e51c6260a1a981b6a14.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/f8c660fc62f90e51c6260a1a981b6a14.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/f8c660fc62f90e51c6260a1a981b6a14.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Attacks On The Fly!</strong> <br>Unlock new attacks by using items. Discover which ones fit your play style! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ad1bd6bc08c545169a1aa762e71c45c6.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ad1bd6bc08c545169a1aa762e71c45c6.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ad1bd6bc08c545169a1aa762e71c45c6.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Crushing Combos!</strong><br>Mix and match items and attacks to discover devastating attack chains.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/48bc962690249b8280352cb6317cb1d8.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/48bc962690249b8280352cb6317cb1d8.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/48bc962690249b8280352cb6317cb1d8.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartment-Scale Adventure\u00a0</strong><br> Each unit is its own world complete with tenants, side quests, secrets, and signature-worthy struggles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/0d464e2db4c0526e016bb4d0d7c8abd5.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/0d464e2db4c0526e016bb4d0d7c8abd5.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/0d464e2db4c0526e016bb4d0d7c8abd5.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Revolution In Petitions\u00a0</strong> <br>Collect signatures from reluctant neighbors in your quest to stop an exterminator and maybe save your sick best friend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/725024d92075b0673907783fca7c85fa.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/725024d92075b0673907783fca7c85fa.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/725024d92075b0673907783fca7c85fa.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strengthen The Chosen One's Powers!</strong>  <br>Choose your attacks, complete quests, and strengthen The Chosen One on a journey through bugs and bureaucracy.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/7a2421eaecba22e3d7d8ab6ca7fff88a.poster.avif?t=1772949369\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/7a2421eaecba22e3d7d8ab6ca7fff88a.webm?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/7a2421eaecba22e3d7d8ab6ca7fff88a.mp4?t=1772949369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bugs With Agendas\u00a0</strong><br>Uncover a hidden network of ant-run schemes, shady businesses, and strange operations all part of a larger scheme buried just beneath the floorboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/8a79ce1a37608549582f318b0905e06c.avif?t=1772949369\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921650?t=1772949369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921650?t=1772949369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/8be8b0b4af467f154bc125065663ed598cf7420b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772949369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/8be8b0b4af467f154bc125065663ed598cf7420b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772949369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"desc